 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure to determine whether the sequence of vertices in the given graph is a Hamilton path, an Euler trail, both, or neither. \n<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/fc5857f11a4e3d19.png\" alt=\"Three graphs. Graph G has six vertices: c, d, e, b, f, and g. Edges connect c d, d e, e g, d g, d f, b f, b g, c f, and f g. Graph N has six vertices: h, i, n, k, j, and m. Edges connect h i, i n, n k, i k, i j, k j, k m, m j, and j h. Graph W has seven vertices: t, s, r, o, q, v, and w. Edges connect t o, t s, s r, r w, q o, q v, and w v.\">\n\n",
